To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},

We recently sent you an email regarding your defaulted purchase and sale of future receivables agreement. We have not received a response so we wanted to reach out again. We have several repayment options available right now, so please still reach out and we will see what we can work out.

Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss payment options.

Sincerely,

{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}

